OL,5,G1900 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith almost a fifth of fatal
OL,7,     Finjuries on UK's roads caused by
OL,8,     Fdrink driving, cops face pressure
OL,9,     Fto stop drivers under the
OL,10,     Finfluence. A biker is knocked off
OL,11,     Fhis bike by a drink driver.
OL,12,G2000 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FBertie pursues a champagne pink
OL,14,     Fhatchback. The driver causes
OL,15,     Fmayhem when he crashes into a
OL,16,     Fbollard, exposing live wires,
OL,17,     Fbefore shorting out the power at
OL,18,     Fthe local boating lake!
